            <member alias='In meetings, I felt safe sharing opinions with my squad.' value='9.' />
            <member alias='I would recommend joining my squad to a friend or a colleague.' value='10.' />
            <member alias='I used my strengths and skills to contribute to the squad on a daily basis.' value='11.' />
